 {
  "kind": "merged-new-text",
  "old_en": [],
  "old_kr": [],
  "new_en": [
   "",
   ":: Kylar Bedroom Letter",
   "<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to \"home\">><<effects>><<wearProp \"note\">>",
   "<<npc Kylar>><<person1>>",
   "",
   "A letter lies on your bed. Someone must have broken into your room. <<stress 6>><<gstress>>",
   "<br><br>",
   "",
   "Cautiously, you open it. All stiff and crinkled, the letter is written in blood, reeking of metal<<= $settings.watersportsEnabled ? \", piss\": \"\">> and cum.<<= playerIsPregnant() ? \" You retch at the smell.\": \"\">> Your breath quickens. <<stress 6>><<gstress>>",
   "<br><br>",
   "",
   "/* Picking a school LI for the letter. Will prioritize LIs set in the attitudes menu, then LIs that have been unlocked as LIs, then just any one of them as a last resort*/",
   "<<set _setLI to []>>",
   "<<set _unlockedLI to []>>",
   "<<set _schoolLI to []>>",
   "<<silently>><<for _li range [\"Robin\", \"Sydney\", \"Whitney\"]>>",
   "\t<<= isLoveInterest(_li) ? _setLI.push(_li) : isPossibleLoveInterest(_li) ? _unlockedLI.push(_li) : _schoolLI.push(_li)>>",
   "<</for>><</silently>>",
   "",
   "<blockquote>",
   "\t<em>",
   "\t\t\"Dear <<kylar_pet_name>>,",
   "\t\t<br><br>",
   "",
   "\t\tI love you.",
   "\t\t<br><br>",
   "",
   "\t\tI'm not really good at expressing myself verbally, so I wrote you a love letter. Does it please you, <<kylar_pet_name>>? I hope it does. I know it does. You love me, after all, don't you? I love you, too.",
   "\t\t<br><br>",
   "",
   "\t\t/* the grammar here is intentional */",
   "\t\tYou like to visit me in my dreams, don't you, since my dreams are made of only you.<<= !_kylarStatus.includes(\"Love\") ? \" In my dreams, you love me back.\": \"\">> Do you dream of me, too? I hope you do.",
   "\t\t<br><br>",
   "",
   "\t\tI want you, all of you. I worship at the altar of you. We belong together. You're mine and I'm yours. It's written in the stars, <<kylar_pet_name>>!",
   "\t\t<br><br>",
   "",
   "\t\tI can't even imagine my life without you. You gave it meaning for I am nothing without you.",
   "\t\t<<if C.npc.Kylar.rage gte 60>>",
   "\t\t\tSo, why do you keep looking the other way? At <<= _setLI.length gte 1 ? _setLI.pluck() : _unlockedLI.length gte 1 ? _unlockedLI.pluck() : _schoolLI.pluck()>>? Not at me? Can't you see my heart? Is my love not enough? Am I... not enough?",
   "\t\t<</if>>",
   "\t\t<br><br>",
   "",
   "\t\tYou should lick the paper. I've infused my bodily fluids on it. It tastes like me, I hope. I want it to permeate into your body, letting my undying love reach your heart. Thinking about it makes me...",
   "\t\t<br><br>",
   "",
   "\t\tForever yours,",
   "\t\t<br>",
   "\t\tKylar",
   "\t\t<br><br>",
   "",
   "\t\t<div class=\"text-clip\"><<for _i to 0; _i lt 15; _i++>>loveyoui<</for>></div>",
   "\t\t<div class=\"text-clip\"><<for _i to 0; _i lt 15; _i++>>youilove<</for>></div>",
   "\t\t<div class=\"text-clip\"><<for _i to 0; _i lt 15; _i++>>I love you. <</for>></div>",
   "\t\t<div class=\"text-clip\"><<for _i to 0; _i lt 15; _i++>>you. I love <</for>></div>",
   "\t\t<div class=\"text-clip\"><<for _i to 0; _i lt 15; _i++>>ILOVEYOU<</for>></div>",
   "\t\t<div class=\"text-clip\"><<for _i to 0; _i lt 15; _i++>>YOUILOVE<</for>></div>",
   "\t\t\"",
   "\t</em>",
   "</blockquote>",
   "",
   "Hearing a rustling sound outside, you <<= $speech_attitude is \"meek\" ? \"fearfully\" : $speech_attitude is \"bratty\" ? \"quickly\" : \"tentatively\">> look up.",
   "<br><br>",
   "",
   "<<if $rng lte (C.npc.Kylar.love - 50)/2>>",
   "\tKylar stares back at you with a crazed smile, panting, <<his>> palms pressed against the window. \"I love you,\" <<he>> mouths",
   "\t<<if C.npc.Kylar.lust gte 60>> ",
   "\t\tand <<= [\"kisses\", \"licks\", \"draws a heart on\"].pluck()>> the glass",
   "\t<</if>>",
   "\tbefore disappearing into the dark.",
   "<<else>>",
   "\tNo one's there.",
   "<</if>>",
   "<<stress 6>><<gstress>>",
   "<br><br>",
   "",
   "<<link [[Keep the letter|Kylar Bedroom Letter 2]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<npcincr Kylar love 1>><</link>><<glove>>",
   "<br>",
   "<<link [[Lick the letter|Kylar Bedroom Letter 2]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<npcincr Kylar love 3>><<npcincr Kylar lust 3>><</link>><<gglove>><<gglust>>",
   "<br>",
   "<<link [[Trash the letter|Kylar Bedroom Letter 2]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<npcincr Kylar love -1>><<npcincr Kylar rage 1>><</link>><<llove>><<gksuspicion>>",
   "<br>",
   "",
   ":: Kylar Bedroom Letter 2",
   "<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to \"home\">><<effects>>",
   "",
   "<<if $phase is 1>>",
   "\t<<wearProp \"note\">>",
